  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VNM-TCCF Plastics Circularity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project supports Viet Nam in addressing its plastic problem through several key interventions. The National Plastic Action Partnership (NPAP) platform will facilitate stakeholder engagement, knowledge sharing, and innovation scaling to promote plastic action. A scheme will be implemented across three fishing ports to encourage 500 fishing boats and 2,500 fishermen to bring plastic waste back to shore for collection and recycling, aiming to collect 7,000 tons of plastic waste in three years.</narrative>
  </description>
